# Qt changeEvent + setStyleSheet

Never `setStyleSheet` from `changeEvent` on `StyleChange` — infinite recursion / stack overflow (0xC00000FD).
Apply stylesheet once in constructor. `PaletteChange` updates use `QPalette` + reentrancy guard only.
Pipela: `_PairedControlTabBar` uses `setStyle(nullptr)` for custom paint — do not re-apply QSS from `changeEvent`.
